    "cancellationPolicy": "If an order cannot be shipped, we refund the XOR received, including shipping, minus the SORA network fee for sending the refund. Your original payment’s network fee is non-refundable. Refunds go to the verified paying wallet. Contact support to cancel before dispatch; refund processing has no fixed deadline."
